source: crates/test-framework/src/snapshot/mod.rs
description: "Query: tpch_q7"
---
+---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
+---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Federated                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
|               |  Sort: SHIPPING.SUPP_NATION ASC NULLS LAST, SHIPPING.CUST_NATION ASC NULLS LAST, SHIPPING.L_YEAR ASC NULLS LAST                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |   Projection: SHIPPING.SUPP_NATION, SHIPPING.CUST_NATION, SHIPPING.L_YEAR, sum(SHIPPING.VOLUME) AS REVENUE                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |     Aggregate: groupBy=[[SHIPPING.SUPP_NATION, SHIPPING.CUST_NATION, SHIPPING.L_YEAR]], aggr=[[sum(SHIPPING.VOLUME)]]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |       SubqueryAlias: SHIPPING                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |         Projection: n1.N_NAME AS SUPP_NATION, n2.N_NAME AS CUST_NATION, date_part(Utf8("YEAR"), snowflake.TPCH_SF1.LINEITEM.L_SHIPDATE) AS L_YEAR, snowflake.TPCH_SF1.LINEITEM.L_EXTENDEDPRICE * (Int64(1) - snowflake.TPCH_SF1.LINEITEM.L_DISCOUNT) AS VOLUME                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |           Inner Join:  Filter: snowflake.TPCH_SF1.CUSTOMER.C_NATIONKEY = n2.N_NATIONKEY AND (n1.N_NAME = Utf8("FRANCE") AND n2.N_NAME = Utf8("GERMANY") OR n1.N_NAME = Utf8("GERMANY") AND n2.N_NAME = Utf8("FRANCE"))                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |             Inner Join:  Filter: snowflake.TPCH_SF1.SUPPLIER.S_NATIONKEY = n1.N_NATIONKEY                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
|               |               Inner Join:  Filter: snowflake.TPCH_SF1.CUSTOMER.C_CUSTKEY = snowflake.TPCH_SF1.ORDERS.O_CUSTKEY                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |                 Inner Join:  Filter: snowflake.TPCH_SF1.ORDERS.O_ORDERKEY = snowflake.TPCH_SF1.LINEITEM.L_ORDERKEY                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
|               |                   Inner Join:  Filter: snowflake.TPCH_SF1.SUPPLIER.S_SUPPKEY = snowflake.TPCH_SF1.LINEITEM.L_SUPPKEY                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |                     TableScan: snowflake.TPCH_SF1.SUPPLIER projection=[S_SUPPKEY, S_NATIONKEY]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |                     TableScan: snowflake.TPCH_SF1.LINEITEM projection=[L_ORDERKEY, L_SUPPKEY, L_EXTENDEDPRICE, L_DISCOUNT, L_SHIPDATE], full_filters=[snowflake.TPCH_SF1.LINEITEM.L_SHIPDATE BETWEEN CAST(Utf8("1995-01-01") AS Date32) AND CAST(Utf8("1996-12-31") AS Date32)]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |                   TableScan: snowflake.TPCH_SF1.ORDERS projection=[O_ORDERKEY, O_CUSTKEY]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
|               |                 TableScan: snowflake.TPCH_SF1.CUSTOMER projection=[C_CUSTKEY, C_NATIONKEY]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |               Filter: n1.N_NAME = Utf8("FRANCE") OR n1.N_NAME = Utf8("GERMANY")                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |                 SubqueryAlias: n1                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |                   TableScan: snowflake.TPCH_SF1.NATION projection=[N_NATIONKEY, N_NAME], full_filters=[snowflake.TPCH_SF1.NATION.N_NAME = Utf8("FRANCE") OR snowflake.TPCH_SF1.NATION.N_NAME = Utf8("GERMANY")]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |             Filter: n2.N_NAME = Utf8("GERMANY") OR n2.N_NAME = Utf8("FRANCE")                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |               SubqueryAlias: n2                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |                 TableScan: snowflake.TPCH_SF1.NATION projection=[N_NATIONKEY, N_NAME], full_filters=[snowflake.TPCH_SF1.NATION.N_NAME = Utf8("GERMANY") OR snowflake.TPCH_SF1.NATION.N_NAME = Utf8("FRANCE")]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
| physical_plan | SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
|               |   CooperativeExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |     BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |       VirtualExecutionPlan name=snowflake compute_context=username=SGREBNOV,account=MAAGZJQ-BIB84773,warehouse=COMPUTE_WH,role=accountadmin base_sql=SELECT "SHIPPING"."SUPP_NATION", "SHIPPING"."CUST_NATION", "SHIPPING"."L_YEAR", sum("SHIPPING"."VOLUME") AS "REVENUE" FROM (SELECT "n1"."N_NAME" AS "SUPP_NATION", "n2"."N_NAME" AS "CUST_NATION", date_part('YEAR', "LINEITEM"."L_SHIPDATE") AS "L_YEAR", ("LINEITEM"."L_EXTENDEDPRICE" * (1 - "LINEITEM"."L_DISCOUNT")) AS "VOLUME" FROM "BENCHMARKS"."TPCH_SF1"."SUPPLIER" INNER JOIN "BENCHMARKS"."TPCH_SF1"."LINEITEM" ON (("SUPPLIER"."S_SUPPKEY" = "LINEITEM"."L_SUPPKEY") AND ("LINEITEM"."L_SHIPDATE" BETWEEN CAST('1995-01-01' AS DATE) AND CAST('1996-12-31' AS DATE))) INNER JOIN "BENCHMARKS"."TPCH_SF1"."ORDERS" ON ("ORDERS"."O_ORDERKEY" = "LINEITEM"."L_ORDERKEY") INNER JOIN "BENCHMARKS"."TPCH_SF1"."CUSTOMER" ON ("CUSTOMER"."C_CUSTKEY" = "ORDERS"."O_CUSTKEY") INNER JOIN "BENCHMARKS"."TPCH_SF1"."NATION" AS "n1" ON (("SUPPLIER"."S_NATIONKEY" = "n1"."N_NATIONKEY") AND (("n1"."N_NAME" = 'FRANCE') OR ("n1"."N_NAME" = 'GERMANY'))) INNER JOIN "BENCHMARKS"."TPCH_SF1"."NATION" AS "n2" ON ((("CUSTOMER"."C_NATIONKEY" = "n2"."N_NATIONKEY") AND ((("n1"."N_NAME" = 'FRANCE') AND ("n2"."N_NAME" = 'GERMANY')) OR (("n1"."N_NAME" = 'GERMANY') AND ("n2"."N_NAME" = 'FRANCE')))) AND (("n2"."N_NAME" = 'GERMANY') OR ("n2"."N_NAME" = 'FRANCE')))) AS "SHIPPING" GROUP BY "SHIPPING"."SUPP_NATION", "SHIPPING"."CUST_NATION", "SHIPPING"."L_YEAR" ORDER BY "SHIPPING"."SUPP_NATION" ASC NULLS LAST, "SHIPPING"."CUST_NATION" ASC NULLS LAST, "SHIPPING"."L_YEAR" ASC NULLS LAST |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
+---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
